  <main class="content">
<p>St Francis Girls Suwerwa provides a safe, modern campus purpose-built to support academic learning, boarding life, spiritual growth, and recreation, every facility exists to help students thrive in and out of the classroom.</p>

<div class="mvv-grid">
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">📚</span>
    <h3>Modern Classrooms</h3>
    <p>Well-lit, spacious classrooms designed for focused learning, equipped with the resources every learner needs to thrive.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">🔬</span>
    <h3>Science Laboratories</h3>
    <p>Fully equipped Biology, Chemistry and Physics laboratories give students hands-on experience with practical experiments.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">💻</span>
    <h3>ICT &amp; Computer Lab</h3>
    <p>A 40-station computer laboratory supporting ICT lessons and digital literacy across the curriculum.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">📖</span>
    <h3>Library &amp; Resource Centre</h3>
    <p>A quiet, well-stocked library and reading room supporting research, revision and a love of reading.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">🏠</span>
    <h3>Boarding &amp; Dormitories</h3>
    <p>Comfortable, secure dormitories that give boarding students a safe home away from home.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">⛪</span>
    <h3>School Chapel</h3>
    <p>A dedicated chapel and prayer grounds at the heart of our Christian-based education.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">⚽</span>
    <h3>Sports Fields &amp; Recreation</h3>
    <p>Spacious sports fields and recreation areas supporting athletics, netball, football and more.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mvv-card">
    <span class="mvv-icon">🍽️</span>
    <h3>Dining Hall</h3>
    <p>A central dining hall serving nutritious meals to the school community daily.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="section-heading">Built for Holistic Growth</h2>
<p>Every facility at SFGS is maintained to support our mission of holistic, Christian-based education, from the classroom and laboratory to the dormitory and chapel. See these spaces for yourself in our <a href="gallery.html">photo gallery</a>.</p>
